      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "text": "森林里危机四伏。准备好后再出发；有十枚金币时，我也可以助你修行。"
    },
    {
      "key": "story.village.elderOffer.text",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "The forest is dangerous. Prepare before leaving; ten gold will also buy training."
    }
